# Cursor / Claude Agent Rules

Before writing any code, always read the files in the `docs/` folder to align with the active architectural constraints, task list, and current memory state.

Whenever a coding task is completed, update `docs/tasks.md` with a checkmark and document technical lessons learned or project state changes in `docs/memory.md`.

Do not invent features, add dependencies, or change stack decisions outside `docs/` without explicit user approval.
